/target

# Scratch git worktrees created by tooling for parallel agent runs. These are
# full checkouts of this repository -- 30 MB at the time of writing, and the
# working copies of work that is still in progress. Committing them would put a
# copy of the tree inside the tree.
#
# Scoped to `worktrees/` rather than all of `.claude/`, so that if project
# configuration ever lives beside them it is still tracked.
.claude/worktrees/

# Extra CA certificates for the container build (deploy/ca/README.md explains
# why the mechanism exists). The certificates an organisation uses are its own;
# a repository is the wrong place for them.
deploy/ca/*.crt
deploy/.env
